Task: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines schema for task entities.

Owns: schemas\task.sdd
Required:
  @task <id>
  title "<title>"
  state <state>

Optional:
  domain <domain>
  risk <LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH|CRITICAL>
  level <L0-L5>
  depends <id>
  skills <skill-list>
  flow <workflow>
  owner <role>
  priority <P0-P4>
  evidence <evidence-list>

Example:
  @task TASK-1023
  title "Prevent duplicate refund"
  domain payments
  risk high
  level L2
  depends 999
  skills idempotency transaction payment-security
  flow BDD>BE>QA>SEC>VR
  state ready

State: +
  
